<title>ITALY: Gross yield 6.03 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 6.03 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 11.5 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.03	(7.20)    98.52	  (98.18)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.00	(7.39)    97.08	  (96.37)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.56	(7.41)    93.85	  (93.05)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on March 25.</p>
</text>
